    "ambient": "Existing interpreter removes every RUST_INTERP_ variable from Cargo/VM base. On refuses conflicting ambient modes and writes only the application Cargo copy; no profile override or std-policy injection.",
    "association": "installed_tools hashes selected binaries; runtime_tools validates composition/key/compiler roles/driver; helper binds exact typed policy, sysroot/roles and physical wrapper digest; launch receipt repeats the selected wrapper.",
