    "default_and_off": "namespace(identity, off) returns original bytes; new receipt absent; same original Cargo/profile/VM path. None per-arm selection returns before capability reads.",
    "paired": "Both modes required; same toolset/runtime/std, complete VM/guest settings and jobs enforced at setup and finish. A/A requires equal modes; RBC equality required.",
    "placement": "Adjacent interpreter/helper selected while R provider owner stays explicit; workflow_runtime_arms byte-identical; external script refs use explicit absolute paths and are rechecked.",
    "saved": "validate_report checks paired settings/runtime association; verify_call rejects wrong/duplicate/noncanonical new flag, missing/mutated policy receipt and differing physical wrapper. Ordinary verifier retains source/RBC/catalog/restoration/negative controls."
  },
